type: dataset
title: "Data Center Atlas: Verified Construction Core"
abstract: >-
  An open, evidence-backed dataset of data-centre construction worldwide. Each
  project has a dated, authoritative observation of physical construction work
  no more than 90 days before a fixed lifecycle reference date (2026-08-20), a
  reviewed locator with explicit precision semantics, and closed-set evidence
  rows with source URLs, licences, retrieval times and content hashes. Version
  2026-08-20-v0.18-draft-thirty-fifth-reviewed (checkpoint 2026-09-25) contains
  197 physical sites with 200 projects in 46 countries, backed by 897 evidence
  rows. It is a reviewed draft, not a final release; the release gates it has
  not met are listed at
  https://kiankyars.github.io/datacenter-atlas/methodology/#release-gates.
  Statuses are the last observed physical status, not the current status;
  locators are not building footprints; capacity is unknown unless a typed
  observation exists; and the dataset is not a census. Atlas-authored data are
  licensed CC BY 4.0; geometries derived from OpenStreetMap are © OpenStreetMap
  contributors under the ODbL 1.0, and other third-party facts keep their source
  terms (see DATA_LICENSE.md).
